<Project>
  <!-- P8-47 (SP-11). Every project under sim/ builds with warnings as errors.

       MSBuild reads the nearest Directory.Build.props walking up from each
       project file, so this covers Ferrostorm.Sim, Ferrostorm.Net,
       Ferrostorm.Presentation and the runner wherever they are built from,
       including when the game or the balance tool builds them through a
       ProjectReference. It does not reach tools/ or game/ themselves.

       Why: two dead constants in the runner (P7-23 and P7-25) raised CS0219
       on every build from the day they landed and nothing acted on it,
       because a warning that fails nothing is read by nobody. A new warning now stops the build where it is introduced,
       which is the only point at which it is cheap to fix. -->
  <PropertyGroup>
    <TreatWarningsAsErrors>true</TreatWarningsAsErrors>
  </PropertyGroup>
</Project>
